A new strategy game, continuing the Age of Empires series, has been released. The third version boasts the same captivating gameplay unique to this project. To make the New World yours, choose one of the available powers and, with skillful leadership, achieve your desired goal. Power and wealth — you can achieve all of this by downloading the Age of Empires 3 torrent and getting started! Conquer new territories, develop — it's all in your hands!

Game features:
- Age of Empires 3: The WarChiefs. This expansion challenges players to take control of one of the available civilizations, representing the Native Americans, as they fight to claim their land. The civilizations include the Aztecs, Sioux, and Iroquois. Other features include a revamped gameplay experience, new units for existing nations, several new action cards, and an improved and expanded statistics system.
- Age of Empires 3: The Asian Dynasties. This expansion also features new nations, but they are represented by the populations of eastern lands. More than a dozen new wonders of the world have been added for construction, trade has been improved and modified, and new map templates will be available to choose from.

Features of RePack
- Nothing is cut out;
- Nothing is recoded;

